{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1 最均衡，既保住了 v6 的核心愿望及其暂时不再折磨他的变化，也写出了狂喜、未获保证和期待回返之间的关系。keep：C1 对积攒的关心、渴望被珍惜、旧日难堪暂退、当下仿佛心愿已足以及仍未得到保证都保留得较完整；C3 次之，少了旧日难堪暂退这一层；C2 对积攒的温柔和许多感情值得珍惜的表达较弱。cover：C2 把眼前的亲近、想对对方好的心思写成忘我和暂时搁下未来的原因，又保留了欢喜退去后对方是否选择自己的悬念，因果交代最清楚；C1 对狂喜的强度和自我退居后面的状态更有表现力，但部分是在描述状态；C3 的原因交代最少。lean：C3 最紧凑，心理步骤少，虽然第三条与末条对未获回应的期待略有重复；C1 第二条稍显堆叠；C2 连续几条重复以眼前的亲近为起点，略显拆碎。plain：C2 最像一个人在具体讲自己的心事，尤其是想好好关心对方、看看两人能过怎样的日子；C1 略带文学化表达，但仍然具体；C3 的许多真情值得珍惜稍显抽象，像在总结感受。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9abfef91-69c7-499e-b8ba-11e0c20806ae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T230502294579Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:06:37.346140+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "91e2cd6a7b226464c39a1d913a6a3c81a823d274ad4257b7c9bca973eabd8b4d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\cha